{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quill &amp; Sword: Fate of Eryndor</strong> is a <strong>fantasy grand strategy game</strong> where diplomacy, warfare, and ambition collide. Rule as a human king, dwarven thane, elven archon, or orc warlord\u2014each with unique strengths, cultures, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your realm\u2019s economy, command armies across provinces, and negotiate alliances or betrayals that will reshape the map. Expand your influence through <strong>tactical warfare</strong>, <strong>political maneuvering</strong>, and <strong>resource management</strong>, or seek peace through trade and diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Eryndor</strong> is alive and ever-changing\u2014kingdoms rise and fall, borders shift, and every decision carries weight. Will your realm endure through cunning and steel, or be forgotten beneath the banners of others?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your legacy\u2014one quill stroke and sword swing at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094800?t=1771458376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094800?t=1771458376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094800/d80ce37473d4cb9c397ea56c01a7d56589a17157/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771458376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094800/d80ce37473d4cb9c397ea56c01a7d56589a17157/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771458376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[